| step2_label = Recognise the lattice geometry
| step2_text  = Microtubule tubulins assemble into a helical lattice with very regular spacing. This places ~10⁶–10⁸ tryptophans in a precisely periodic 3D array — the optical analogue of a perfect crystal.
